  "name": "Compressed Moissanite X-Grade",
  "description": "This variant of Moissanite ore is especially prized by Gallente engineers for use in large-scale construction projects. Deposits have been held in reserve until such a time as the Federation needed them.\n\nUnlike regular Moissanite ore, X-Grade is more stable and can be reprocessed without specialized equipment into <a href=showinfo:34>Tritanium</a> and <a href=showinfo:35>Pyerite</a>.\n\nReprocessing will also produce <a href=showinfo:97514>Aberrant Moissanite</a>. The Federation will reward anyone who accepts their campaign objective and delivers this Aberrant material to their item trader outside the Federation Navy Anchorage in <url=showinfo:5//30003788>Intaki</url>.\n\nThis material is compressed and a much more compact form of the original material.",
